# Playwright (ysk.bel)

Single **`playwright.config.mjs`**. **Projects:** `chromium-{mobile|tablet|desktop}` (home screenshots, `testIgnore` width spec), **`width-pass`** (`**/home-width-pass.spec.js`, `width-snapshots/`), **`a11y`** (`tests/a11y/`).

**One static server** on **4173** for all projects (width pass no longer uses a second port).

## Layout

- DOM: `src/scripts/constants/dom/*.cjs` → **`homePageDom.cjs`**; tests use **`require()`** in `tests/visual/constants.js` + `home-snapshot-helpers.cjs`.
- **constants.js:** `VIEWPORTS`, `BLOCKED_THIRD_PARTY_URL_GLOBS`, `LAYOUT.footerMinVisibleWidthPx`.
- **Baselines:** `home-snapshots/` — consolidated **`main-content`**, **`cooperation-banner`**, **`footer`** (× Chromium × viewport × `{darwin|linux}`); **`width-snapshots/`** for width pass only.

## Scripts

| Command | Scope |
|---------|--------|
| `yarn test:visual` | Home 3 viewports + width-pass |
| `yarn test:visual:home` | Home snapshots only (`chromium-{mobile|tablet|desktop}`, no width-pass) |
| `yarn exec playwright test --project=width-pass` | Width pass alone |
| `yarn test:a11y` | Axe only |
| `yarn test:playwright` | All projects |

**`PLAYWRIGHT_PREBUILT_DIST=1`** — `webServer` serves **`dist/`** only (CI visual job).

## CI

- **`.github/actions/setup-yarn-playwright`:** `actions/setup-node` + **`cache:yarn`**, **`actions/cache`** on **`~/.cache/ms-playwright`**, `yarn install --immutable`, **`playwright install chromium --with-deps`**.
- **build** `ci.yaml`: parity → composite → `yarn build` → unit → **`yarn test:a11y`** → PR upload **`site-dist`**.
- **visual:** download **`dist/`** → composite → **`PLAYWRIGHT_PREBUILT_DIST=1` `yarn test:visual`** → on failure upload **`test-results/`**.
- **update-visual-snapshots:** composite → **`yarn test:visual --update-snapshots`** → commit **`home-snapshots`** + **`width-snapshots`** `*-linux.png`.

## Notes

Header mobile menu, waits, map mask, blocked URLs — see **`tests/visual/constants.js`** and helpers.
